From: Shayne <8741557+shaynelegault@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:02:08 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] mtd: apple-sftl: Copy and verify live pages during
 reclamation

Pack live ordinary data into complete pages with native sequence metadata. Check destination blankness and read back the full data and OOB after each program. Preserve mapping order when a page needs padding, honor the measured source footer width, and stop after any uncertain I/O. Compare live and cold maps before authorizing a retired block for reuse.

Assisted-by: LLM
